// every tip on the earth loading screens page (earth-loading-screens.html), one per line. to add one,
// copy a line and change it:
//
//   pic   a picture's name on Wikimedia Commons: the end of its page's address, or its title without
//         "File:". any picture on Commons works, including the one at the top of a Wikipedia article
//   text  the caption. [[double brackets]] link words to their Wikipedia article, [[Article|words]]
//         links other words to it, and letters straight after the brackets join the link, so
//         [[Shadow]]s links "Shadows" to the Shadow article, the way Wikipedia writes links.
//         a caption copied from a Wikipedia article is fine (they're CC BY-SA, credited on the page)
//
// then run  node js/earth-loading-screens/check-tips.js  to check every line and that every picture is
// really on Commons. the page shows them in a shuffled order, so where a line goes doesn't matter
